        "eof": true
      },
      "text": "enum VeryVerboseEnumOfThingsToDoWithNumbers {\n    Add,\n    Subtract,\n}\n\n// 创建一个类型别名\ntype Operations = VeryVerboseEnumOfThingsToDoWithNumbers;\n\nimpl VeryVerboseEnumOfThingsToDoWithNumbers {\n    fn run(&self, x: i32, y: i32) -> i32 {\n        match self {\n            Self::Add => x + y,\n            Self::Subtract => x - y,\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    // 通过别名引用枚举变量，避免写出又长又不方便的枚举名字。\n    let add = Operations::Add;\n    let subtract = Operations::Subtract;\n\n    println!(\"10 + 4 = {}\", add.run(10, 4));\n    println!(\"10 - 4 = {}\", subtract.run(10, 4));\n}\n",
